  "title": "Herjit Bhalla joins Dabur board as CEO Mohit Malhotra steps down",
  "summary": "Dabur India has announced a leadership transition, with Global CEO and Whole-time Director Mohit Malhotra resigning from his positions effective November 13, 2026, after more than three decades with the company. Malhotra is set to take up a leadership role overseas. Dabur has appointed India business CEO Herjit Singh Bhalla as Additional Director and Whole-time Director for five years, effective November 14, subject to regulatory approvals.",
